                        <p>Nastaʻlīq</p>
                     </handNote>
                  </handDesc>
                  <additions>
                     <p>Folio 9 is an extra sheet containing similar details of Delhi Arabic
                        1499-1521 which had previously formed the wrapper of P 1380, an unidentified
                        manuscript in the Delhi Persian collection. </p>
                  </additions>
                  <bindingDesc>
